{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35630","headline":"答刘书记见赠 · 李山甫","name":"答刘书记见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吟近秋光思不穷，酷探骚雅愧无功。\n茫然心苦千篇拙，瞑坐神凝万象空。\n月上开襟当北户，竹边回首揖西风。\n知音频有新诗赠，白雪纷纷落郢中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}